{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>And HaShem will remove from you every illness.</b> That is, what follows the natural order of the world. <b>And all the diseases of Egypt,</b> which were outside the natural order of the world." "<b>Or,</b> one may say: 'every illness' is what comes from outside the body, from the side of the change of the air and its corruption; and 'all the diseases of Egypt' is what comes from within, from inside the body — and this is the sense of ״לא ישימם בך״ (He will not put them upon you)."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:46:29.706246562Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}